--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -244,7 +244,8 @@
 **Special ledges.** Cell codes are not validated by the parser or the game's loader (any byte is a cell). `$91` is a crumbling ledge: the
 game draws it exactly like `$81` but clears it when the frog stands on it (the editor draws it dotted, the legend calls it `crumble`);
 `$a1` / `$b1` are conveyor ledges that push the frog one step left / right while it stands without input; the game draws them like a plain
-ledge too (legend kind `ledge`, the label says what they do).
+ledge too. The v1.2 editor places them (cell menu *Conveyor left* / *Conveyor right*, keys N / M) and draws a ledge with an arrow; the
+legend has the same two glyphs (tiles 19 / 20, kinds `conveyor_left` / `conveyor_right`), so the level map and the thumbnails show the arrows.
 
 ## Security notes
 
